WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.514
Bumble watched Sprite fly through the air.

2
00:00:09.515 --> 00:00:14.341
"I wish I could fly like you, Sprite," he said.

3
00:00:14.342 --> 00:00:20.104
Sprite made a figure eight around Fairy Grove.

4
00:00:20.105 --> 00:00:22.510
"I'll teach you, Bumble."

5
00:00:22.511 --> 00:00:26.043
"Really?" Bumble jumped into the air.

6
00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:28.854
He bumped into Feather's wind chimes.

7
00:00:28.855 --> 00:00:34.850
"Oops, sorry!" he said. "I'm so clumsy!"

8
00:00:34.851 --> 00:00:40.265
Feather sighed. "That's okay, Bumble.

9
00:00:40.266 --> 00:00:46.046
You didn't break them—this time!"

10
00:00:46.047 --> 00:00:49.789
Bumble flew after Sprite.

11
00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:54.425
He tried to keep up with her.

12
00:00:54.426 --> 00:00:59.553
But she was very fast.

13
00:00:59.554 --> 00:01:02.726
Hob watched from his hammock.

14
00:01:02.727 --> 00:01:07.635
"Stop blocking the sun!" he called.

15
00:01:07.636 --> 00:01:15.235
Sprite rolled her eyes. "Hob, go back to sleep.

16
00:01:15.236 --> 00:01:18.077
Bumble, fly faster."

17
00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:24.989
Bumble bit his lip. "I'm afraid I'll bump into something."

18
00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:28.840
"Be brave, Bumble," Sprite said.

19
00:01:28.841 --> 00:01:32.643
"A good flier takes risks!"

20
00:01:32.644 --> 00:01:35.159
Bumble closed his eyes.

21
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.183
Then—

22
00:01:37.184 --> 00:01:40.045
zoom! He flew as fast as he

23
00:01:40.046 --> 00:01:45.106
could. A second later he crashed into Sprite. "Oops!"

24
00:01:45.107 --> 00:01:53.945
Both fairies crashed to the ground.

25
00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.789
"Sorry!" Bumble cried.

26
00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:05.028
Hob laughed. "Sprite, you forgot to teach Bumble something.

27
00:02:05.029 --> 00:02:08.876
Keep your eyes open while flying!"

28
00:02:08.877 --> 00:02:12.036
Sprite scowled at the lazy fairy.

29
00:02:12.037 --> 00:02:15.613
Then she shot over to his hammock—and flipped it!

30
00:02:15.614 --> 00:02:20.151
"Ow!" Hob cried as he tumbled onto the grass.

31
00:02:20.152 --> 00:02:22.813
"That hurt!"

32
00:02:22.814 --> 00:02:27.239
"A birthday wish!" Feather cried suddenly.

33
00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:31.362
Wish smoke was drifting into Fairy Grove.

34
00:02:31.363 --> 00:02:35.157
Hob got up and dusted himself off.

35
00:02:35.158 --> 00:02:39.057
"I hope it's an easy wish," he mumbled.

36
00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:42.206
"Me too!" Bumble said.

37
00:02:42.207 --> 00:02:47.810
The fairies gathered around the wish smoke.

38
00:02:47.811 --> 00:02:51.896
"It's from a girl named Sally," Feather said.

39
00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:56.180
"She wants a friend."

40
00:02:56.181 --> 00:03:00.563
"A friend?" Bumble scratched his head.

41
00:03:00.564 --> 00:03:06.132
"Blinx can't make a person at the factory—can he?"

42
00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:10.254
Sprite shrugged. "Let's follow the smoke.

43
00:03:10.255 --> 00:03:20.801
We'll get a wishbit and learn more about Sally!"

